  "local_id": "{{$guid}}",
  "title": "",
  "summary": "",
  "content": ""
}

### Oczekiwane: 200, notatka utworzona z pustymi polami tekstowymi


### 4.7 sync_state = dowolny nieznany string -> serwer nie waliduje wartosci enuma
POST {{baseUrl}}/sync/upload-note
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "local_id": "{{$guid}}",
  "title": "...",
